{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Growmon Island is a creature-collection idle sandbox that lives in a small area of your desktop so you can multitask while your Growmons grow. Each Growmon progresses through four growth stages \u2014 Egg \u2192 Baby \u2192 Teen \u2192 Adult \u2014 and every stage can branch into multiple evolution paths. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can sell Growmon once it hatches for coin, or <strong>keep it to gain passive boosts</strong>. Train Growmons to increase their quality \u2014 higher quality raises sale value and influences evolution outcomes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Evolve Growmons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Growmon has four growth stages. Eggs hatch into babies, which grow into teens, and finally into adults. At each stage there are <strong>multiple possible evolutions</strong>; which path your Growmon takes depends on how you care for and train it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Your Island</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and upgrade island enclosures with facilities and decorations. Facilities introduce new mechanics and functionality; decorations improve enclosure quality and provide small benefits that make caring for Growmons easier.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Designed for Multitasking</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Growmon Island is optimized to run unobtrusively: place the window anywhere on your screen and resize it to take up as much \u2014 or as little \u2014 space as you like. Enjoy a calm, low-pressure experience while you work, study, or watch a movie.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3640900?t=1760661421","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3640900?t=1760661421","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640900/f83eba252396d68b6e5e9fc6b9fcbfee76734262/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760661421","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640900/f83eba252396d68b6e5e9fc6b9fcbfee76734262/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760661421","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Growmon Island is a creature-collection idle sandbox that lives in a small area of your desktop so you can multitask while your Growmons grow. Each Growmon progresses through four growth stages \u2014 Egg \u2192 Baby \u2192 Teen \u2192 Adult \u2014 and every stage can branch into multiple evolution paths. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can sell Growmon once it hatches for coin, or <strong>keep it to gain passive boosts</strong>. Train Growmons to increase their quality \u2014 higher quality raises sale value and influences evolution outcomes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Evolve Growmons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Growmon has four growth stages. Eggs hatch into babies, which grow into teens, and finally into adults. At each stage there are <strong>multiple possible evolutions</strong>; which path your Growmon takes depends on how you care for and train it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Your Island</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and upgrade island enclosures with facilities and decorations. Facilities introduce new mechanics and functionality; decorations improve enclosure quality and provide small benefits that make caring for Growmons easier.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Designed for Multitasking</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Growmon Island is optimized to run unobtrusively: place the window anywhere on your screen and resize it to take up as much \u2014 or as little \u2014 space as you like. Enjoy a calm, low-pressure experience while you work, study, or watch a movie.</p>","developers":["Ramskull Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://share